          Priority:50,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Grull waits at the pit mouth. Thirty waves, and Kiln-Tok-Jad at the end of them.

When flame gathers in him, raise your shield toward him. When he rises, run from the burning ring. And when his menders come, strike one."
